# Resolved by `op run` whenever the podcast talks to YouTube: uploads, the
# Analytics and Reporting reads. Committed on purpose: every op:// below is a
# REFERENCE, not a value.
#
#   op run --env-file=tools/youtube.env -- ./tools/youtube.py <command>
#
# The client is `podcast-engine` in the Google Cloud project (Desktop app).
# The token is the refresh token `./tools/youtube.py auth` printed once, for
# the brand channel; its username field carries the channel id it is for.
# Both are API Credential items, so the fields are username + credential.
YOUTUBE_CLIENT_ID=op://Engineering/YouTube podcast client/username
YOUTUBE_CLIENT_SECRET=op://Engineering/YouTube podcast client/credential
YOUTUBE_REFRESH_TOKEN=op://Engineering/YouTube podcast token/credential
